# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Kaitai struct definition for: Miax MiaxOptions ClearingTradeDrop Ctd v1.3.a
#
# Protocol:
#   Organization: Miami International Holdings
#   Protocol: Clearing Trade Drop
#   Encoding: Miax Clearing Trade Drop
#   Version: 1.3.a
#   Date: 02/08/2013
#   Specification: Clearing_Trade_Drop_CTD_v1_3a.pdf
#
